{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9dde882e87303493da899c8474ad4c70c8086bd6520939b97f112a130158711b", "ja": "（そろそろ、新しい劇場公演について考えないとだな。\n次はどんな公演にするか……少し趣向を変えたいけど）", "zh": "（差不多该考虑一下新的剧场公演了。下一场要办成什么样呢……虽然想稍微换个风格。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "1c88bbe3f6762847dd5023b4ef5130a8ac3146c12d0e5365913ceff713fe261d", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん♪\n社長さんが～お呼～びでしたよ～っ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生～♪\n社长～叫您过去～哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "70b36d89eb85bedf058bbda1e28d42bccb15edc0c56ac03d1461f8a5ac686c31", "ja": "えっ？　あ、青羽さん？", "zh": "咦？啊，青羽小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "4cc28329029bba7efa3f3a6f9541b6b8994090ec4cfd3447e851437fabc837b3", "ja": "……？\nどうしたんですか、そんなびっくりした顔して？", "zh": "……？\n怎么了吗，摆出这么吃惊的表情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "605fc90d0b2bf2d4ab9a4332811e843f851ea3080600a0e07c91ade7349447dd", "ja": "いえ、なんというか、\nいつも以上に楽しそうだなと思って。", "zh": "不是，我只是觉得……\n你今天看起来比平时还要开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "53e3c41f4cd7a5f5e56ada13cbf6c621ebb1f3cba07905fa67e641c353835439", "ja": "えへへ、そうですか？\n実はさっき、音無先輩にほめられ……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，是这样吗？\n其实刚才被音无前辈夸奖了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "53880e0dc74e3e2a784ae372c8805dab2ca01bbf8ae1eae6b22c9c5f10c9930a", "ja": "……はっ！！　いけない！！\n私ってば、つい歌いながら……！！", "zh": "……啊！！糟糕！！\n我真是的，不知不觉就哼着歌……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "8d2514592ac068557b0cf42f0c7191c8e8c2bc37a3b4d393c9940a5b64f1f887", "ja": "ち、違うんです。今のはふざけてたわけじゃなくて、\n勢いあまってというか……そのう……。", "zh": "不、不对，不是这样的。刚才不是在胡闹，只是有点得意忘形了……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "52b46b48a6a4f04c948f1693847f532a73f44d1d3a0327e9aab81470891538e9", "ja": "あはは、ふざけてるなんて思ってませんよ。\n歌う事務員っていうのも、アリだと思います！", "zh": "啊哈哈，我可没觉得你是在胡闹哦。\n我觉得“会唱歌的事务员”也挺不错的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "395ef02c8b593345c50963f010b640098a8168fff01146f711a750e4d2c0ebd5", "ja": "わ～っ！　やめてください～！\nフォローされると、もっと恥ずかし～い！", "zh": "哇～！请别说了～！\n被这么一说，反而更害羞了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "24b33562cbc4e6391bfa9ae1a23d5aaf82119894c048415f9850e85efa8ec281", "ja": "そうですか？　……と、とにかく、\n社長のところに行ってきますね。", "zh": "是吗？……总、总之，我先去社长那边一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b0debe4b8cc11ca0667c277d2354b9c14bac1f58de47f377dc35f188f29016b2", "ja": "社長、お待たせしました。", "zh": "社长，让您久等了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "58c630d0ad911e09b3906d9f159b0b587d6f97a725501b3a55d16b35a668c518", "ja": "やあ、よく来てくれたね！\n時に……君は、ミュージカルには詳しいかね？", "zh": "哎呀，你来得正好！\n话说……你对音乐剧有所了解吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "45af2e12edbe825a84cfa1489f9a11f1191495ccaa6052866404d70ef7172b9c", "ja": "ミュージカル？　いえ、詳しいというほどでは\nありませんが……どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "音乐剧？不，还没到熟悉的程度……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "fabd412c1afba348771e7f7bdfde88999b4f92f36545969aec3c5ffd6ac06031", "ja": "実は知り合いの作曲家が、765プロのアイドルに、\nこんな新曲はどうかと、持ってきてくれてね。", "zh": "其实是有位认识的作曲家，带着这首新曲找来，\n问我给765事务所的偶像唱如何呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "21f4dafc2eac550601f02ed447d322b77c3c2d74d06986c5fda1ac63a06445d2", "ja": "それが、とっても素敵な曲なんですけど。\nミュージカル調なんです！", "zh": "那是一首非常棒的曲子，不过是音乐剧风格的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f20a0f17110eeef5193696abd6747b063b9219e3d2eab7d795d99e715639f869", "ja": "なるほど、ミュージカル調……\nそれで、俺に？", "zh": "原来如此，是音乐剧风格……\n所以，是要交给我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "3c56242498f104a279b019a5cf78ecb0dc7c505e7cb2b90dd8d691e3bc2c2134", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さんなら、\nきっと素晴らしい舞台にできると思いますよ♪", "zh": "没错！如果是{$P$}先生，\n一定能打造出精彩的舞台♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "cc93696de4f97cdb97848bf378435ce1e41b2937d8fff54f8b4d6bfba3944e41", "ja": "あー……音無君？\nそれは、私が話そうとしていたことなんだがね……。", "zh": "啊……音无？\n那正是我正想说的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "1f19bb01adf5e9e102450681a647987292cdcca22a043bbd827af881fbc8788f", "ja": "あ、いけない。ご……ごめんなさ～い。", "zh": "啊，不好。对……对不起～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "907d71de2a4ab25e84a9cd3bbcf6ef561534ac4077e4869bce00dd5b5f32feff", "ja": "うぉっほん！　……と、まあ、\nそういうわけなんだ。引き受けてくれるかね？", "zh": "咳咳！……总而言之，\n事情就是这样。你愿意接下这个委托吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c73236bd87cbc79f09498694c3e13d84f15e82325b73b4122ed6af32fb8e6b84", "ja": "ええ、もちろんです！", "zh": "嗯，当然可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "6343817826c4517bde2bcbd6fa850e27deb279b3f19cdfce94567cfc95bda10a", "ja": "うむ。君には早速、メンバーの人選にあたって\nもらいたいんだが……どうだね？", "zh": "嗯。我想请你立刻着手挑选成员……\n意下如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "88cdb581cacd4b973f6a58eb9e0a68924766a3993d90a6b279540c38d35e439f", "ja": "そうですね。ミュージカルは、歌とお芝居ですから。\n物語の内容にもよりますが……。", "zh": "是啊。音乐剧需要唱歌和演戏。\n不过，这也要看故事的内容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "43572322127473d93f12b8303aa95a3b35f911d58c5071ed462c2d3487305b5a", "ja": "演技が巧みな志保と琴葉、まつり。歌の得意な\n歌織さん……今浮かんだのは、この4人でしょうか。", "zh": "擅长演戏的志保、琴叶和茉莉，还有擅长唱歌的歌织……刚才想到的，大概就是这4个人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "3c97d039d27586c5a829f23a3484ddfb2d461cb601b616b171ba719cb9d2cb78", "ja": "なるほど。北沢志保君、桜守歌織君、徳川まつり君、\n田中琴葉君……うむ、実にいいメンバーじゃないか。", "zh": "原来如此。北泽志保、樱守歌织、德川茉莉，\n还有田中琴叶……嗯，成员阵容真是不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "ad84f6ed302b08310c4b696b5ccbc08f8c5ee542f7714431951f0a59ccdb00f6", "ja": "本当ですね！　歌もお芝居も、レベルの\n高いものが期待できそうで……私も楽しみです♪", "zh": "确实如此！无论是歌唱还是演技，似乎都能期待高水准的表现……我也很期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "9076ad365335864a09395172596b10a3940f374ca9bc11a1ba0a8578c97da9b2", "ja": "うむ！　彼女達が、いったいどんなミュージカルを\n作り上げるのか、今から楽しみだよ。", "zh": "嗯！她们究竟会打造出怎样的音乐剧，\n我现在就已经开始期待了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "417d3f810372b31d003b4f137966d27f0974a47ea88c30f7894bbf9f24a47397", "ja": "ミュージカル……音楽に彩られた、華麗なるショウ。\nいやあ、いいものだねえ。私も、若いころは……。", "zh": "音乐剧……一场由音乐点缀的华丽演出。\n哎呀，真是美妙啊。我年轻的时候也曾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "29de9f1ae6eb8dd9a9d4b415b6ae43706b2878e071862462b666dda9904500ea", "ja": "{$P$}さん、そろそろ行ったほうが\nいいと思いますよ。こうなると長いですから。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我觉得差不多\n该动身了哦。他一变成这样就会说很久的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "770e2172fcb5103abe5fb299d500dc128d6dd535d110e1d82cd1d64d43fef79b", "ja": "……そ、そうですね。わかりました。\nそれじゃあ、失礼します。", "zh": "……嗯、我也这么觉得。明白了。\n那么，我先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "281c0a9fd4180d1f67e471ce00e053aa09815b66e83c15519586e29065fa442f", "ja": "（とはいえ、楽しみだな。歌と芝居が合わさって\nミュージカルが生まれるように……）", "zh": "（话虽如此，还真让人期待啊。就像歌唱与戏剧相结合，便能诞生音乐剧一样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "ec5dfd12fe4d915b8f9804e3be5d78888bbb8e2c67dc0acf772113b829c2698c", "ja": "（志保、歌織さん、まつり、琴葉……4人の個性が\n合わされば、最高の舞台を生み出せるに違いない！）", "zh": "（志保、歌织、茉莉、琴叶……4人的个性融合在一起，一定能打造出最棒的舞台！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
